{"version":"2.0-hamji-bilingual","note":"21 hook mechanisms adapted from the MIT-licensed youtube-agent-skill concept set, with bilingual examples and patterns. Scores are heuristic, not performance predictions.","rules":["Confirm the package promise immediately.","One dominant promise per hook.","Specific nouns, numbers, names, dates, or visible artifacts beat vague adjectives.","If the hook promises an artifact, proof, or reveal, show evidence early.","Do not open with creator biography unless biography is the story."],"hooks":[{"id":"the-statistic","name":"The Statistic","match":["\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\s?%","\\d+(?:\\.\\d+)?\\s?배","\\d{2,}(?:,\\d{3})+"]},{"id":"someone-elses-result","name":"Someone Else's Result","match":["이 채널","went from","\\d+\\s?(?:일|주|개월|달|년)"]},{"id":"the-mistake","name":"The Mistake","match":["실수","이유","잘못","멈추","stop"]},{"id":"contrarian-flip","name":"Contrarian Flip","match":["다들","모두","everyone","반대","틀렸"]},{"id":"the-reveal","name":"The Reveal","match":["보여","공개","그대로","show you"]},{"id":"the-superlative","name":"The Superlative","match":["가장 (?:빠른|쉬운|좋은|나쁜)","최고","최악","fastest|best|worst"]},{"id":"the-clock","name":"The Clock","match":["\\d+\\s?(?:초|분|시간)\\s?안","이 영상이 끝","next \\d+ minutes"]},{"id":"i-tried-it","name":"I Tried It","match":["해봤","써봤","맡겨","테스트","I (?:tried|tested|spent)"]},{"id":"the-question","name":"The Question","match":["^(?:왜|어떻게|뭐|무엇|어느|정말)","\\?$","^(?:why|how|what|which)"]},{"id":"the-before-after","name":"Before and After","match":["전.*후","바꾸기 전","바꾼 뒤","before.*after"]},{"id":"the-teardown","name":"The Teardown","match":["뜯어","분석","공통점","teardown|break.*down"]},{"id":"the-stack","name":"The Stack","match":["와 .* 같이","\\+","plus|combine|together"]},{"id":"the-warning","name":"The Warning","match":["하지 마","올리기 전","확인하세요","do not|don't|before you"]},{"id":"the-list","name":"The List","match":["^\\d+","\\d+가지","here are \\d+"]},{"id":"the-receipt","name":"The Receipt","match":["실제 .*화면","스크린샷","증거","proof|screenshot|receipt"]},{"id":"the-insider","name":"The Insider","match":["대부분 .*안","숨겨","안 보는","almost nobody|hidden|buried"]},{"id":"the-impossible","name":"The Impossible Claim","match":["없이","한 번에","0개|제로","without|never|zero"]},{"id":"the-comparison","name":"The Comparison","match":["vs\\.?","대 .*","비교","세 가지|두 가지","which .* wins"]},{"id":"the-origin","name":"The Origin","match":["전부 .*시작","여기서 시작","진짜 이유","it all starts|real reason"]},{"id":"the-deadline","name":"The Deadline","match":["이번 (?:주|달|해)","다음 (?:주|달|해)","부터 바뀌","as of|is changing|no longer"]},{"id":"the-direct-address","name":"The Direct Address","match":["^(?:구독자|초보|처음|지금|만약|만일|여러분)","라면","if you"]}]}